WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.330
Good evening!

00:00:02.710 --> 00:00:06.880
We come to you from the Order of the Crest!
I'm Priestess Priscilla Farnese!

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:09.840
We're good, thanks.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:11.380
Oh, wait a minute, please!

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:15.260
<i>The same last name as the former pope.
Is that the Farnese Crest?</i>

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:16.390
<i>No way, right?</i>

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:22.890
I wish to support Lord Theo
in his divine battle to subdue the Chaos.

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:24.440
Please leave now.

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:27.150
Company? Are you letting them in?

00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:30.360
It's a priestess from
the Order of the Crest.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:34.410
There's no need to welcome the pawn
of an annoying religious sect.

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:37.450
But they appear to have many followers.

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:40.660
And I hear they go around
healing wounds and illness.

00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:46.380
Rumor has it that you've been
trying to confiscate Crests.

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:48.920
A Crest is the manifestation
of its Lord's will.

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:52.720
Not something granted by
this so-called god you created!

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:55.930
So you're a mage, I see!

00:00:56.510 --> 00:00:59.390
A slave to the villainous demon
who controls the Chaos!

00:00:59.390 --> 00:01:03.810
It's far more villainous to manipulate
human souls with your sketchy teachings!

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:05.900
- Make yourselves–
- Oh, let them stay.

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:08.190
They take care of my people, too, after all.

00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:09.440
Lord Theo!

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:12.740
So you're Lord Theo!

00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:19.410
I'm Priscilla,
a priestess of the Order of the Crest.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.500
I look forward to getting to know you!

00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:24.620
Nice to meet you.

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:07.060
That was a huge win for us today!

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:10.850
I'd say we've got the pick of
the free Lords around here,

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:12.690
either to defeat or join our side!

00:03:13.310 --> 00:03:17.820
Getting the local aristocrat, Sir Neyman,
to submit to us was a real coup.

00:03:19.110 --> 00:03:21.660
Meaning that western Savis is now ours!

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:25.580
It won't be long before
you're crowned King of Savis, right?

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:30.580
Lord Theo's goal
is not to expand his territories.

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:33.960
- Huh?
- Lord Theo is from Systina.

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:39.340
He strives to defeat Systina's Lord,
Viscount Rossini, and to save his people.

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:42.260
But that island belongs to the Union.

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:47.310
If we take out Rossini, would that make it
difficult to maintain status in the Union?

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:48.770
Yes.

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:52.190
For that reason, he'll first have
to switch to the Alliance eventually.

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:56.820
Afterwards, he'll make his return to Systina,
and take on Viscount Rossini.

00:03:57.280 --> 00:04:00.070
That's the first I've heard of this plan.

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:01.400
Please forgive me.

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:05.990
I was planning to propose it to you
when the possibility became more realistic.

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:09.870
And now I have a recommendation
for you, Lord Theo.

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:11.290
What is it?

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:13.670
Lord Theo, as you're a Baron now...

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:16.710
let's choose a family name for you.

00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:17.590
Family name?

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:19.260
Yes.

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:22.840
From here on in, Lord Theo,
I'd like you to call yourself Cornaro.

00:04:23.590 --> 00:04:24.430
Cornaro?

00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:26.850
Who's this Cornaro?

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:29.930
It's the family name of a hero of Systina.

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:35.310
One who unified the island, and brought
the magical borders under control,

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:39.360
only to be betrayed by the Rossinis,
and struck down before completing his work.

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:40.940
I see!

00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:44.410
It's clear why anyone from Systina
would want to take him out.

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:47.740
So he's gonna proclaim himself
a descendant of that hero?

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:52.750
Which will raise the people's hopes
for their hero's return, eh?

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:58.630
You weren't kidding when you said
you'd stop at nothing.

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:00.510
I'm not being rash.

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:03.510
I wouldn't want to tarnish your name
in any way, Lord Theo.

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:07.760
But now I know what
you've got in mind, and I like it.

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:11.520
Especially the part
about taking on that Rossini guy!

00:05:11.890 --> 00:05:16.150
Well then, let's begin laying the groundwork
for your transfer to the Alliance.

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:17.020
Moreno.

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:21.780
I'd like you to negotiate
with Viscount Naville, the King of Savis.

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:22.780
Negotiate?

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:25.780
To switch sides to the Alliance,

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:28.950
Lord Theo will need to go
bearing the gift of his current territories.

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:33.290
So I want you to get the King of Savis
to recognize Lord Theo's independence.

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:38.210
Since Viscount Naville
is itching to rule over all of Savis,

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:41.050
announcing our independence
is not going to sit well with him.

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:43.920
I have the utmost faith in your abilities!

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:51.810
So, Viscount Shakes, the King of Clovis,
has agreed to our secret pact?

00:05:53.180 --> 00:05:55.730
So long as Lord Theo stays out of his lands,

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:58.810
he'll recognize his
court rank and independence.

00:05:58.810 --> 00:05:59.650
Thank goodness.

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:02.900
Thank you very much, Sir Sartorus.

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:06.070
Aren't you overstepping a bit, though?

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:06.820
Huh?

00:06:07.610 --> 00:06:11.200
Even though you've been
viciously defeating the opposition,

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:14.080
I've heard no mention of Lord Theo's name.

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:16.750
On the contrary,

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:22.460
I've heard rumors that your Lord is just
decoration, while you're the real mastermind.

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:23.800
No way...

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:27.380
But I'm only thinking of Lord Theo.

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:30.600
I'm not doubting your loyalty.

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:35.600
But don't you think you might
be ignoring Lord Theo's wishes?

00:06:37.850 --> 00:06:38.690
Well, I...

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:44.860
Who's there?

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:46.490
It's Siluca.

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:51.160
Is it something urgent?

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:54.240
No, I wouldn't say that, but...

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:56.000
Um...

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:01.960
Sorry to interrupt you two.

00:07:03.090 --> 00:07:03.920
What is it?

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:07.380
I've been informed that a Chaos Disaster
has occurred in the castle town.

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:10.140
- Let's go!
- R-Right!

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:17.480
What happened?

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:20.100
The coal suddenly exploded.

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:21.400
Damn Chaos!

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:23.690
- Out of the way!
- Wounded coming through!

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:25.110
Boss!

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:26.820
I'll tend to him!

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:32.120
This is going to hurt,
but please bear with me.

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:38.500
Follow me!
We'll put out that fire!

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:41.580
This should help a little...

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:44.960
<i>This feeling...</i>

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:51.930
Siluca!

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:53.720
What is that thing?

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:57.970
A Salamander from Aether?

00:07:58.600 --> 00:07:59.890
Is that a Chaos demon?

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:01.730
Yes. And it's extremely dangerous.

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:03.690
Then I'm taking it out!

00:08:04.440 --> 00:08:05.570
You mustn't, Lord Theo!

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:17.950
Slashing at a projection
from Aether with a sword...

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:19.620
Is he an idiot or what?

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:21.250
Lord Theo! Please get away!

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:24.460
Aishela, draw him towards you for now!

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:25.960
Leave it to me!

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:40.390
Lord Theo, Irvin,
help the townspeople evacuate.

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:41.390
Got it!

00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:43.140
As for the boss...

00:08:44.310 --> 00:08:45.810
Allow me to heal him.

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:48.230
Do you have the ability to?

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:50.650
Please leave it to me.

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:55.490
A Crest?

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:58.830
It's all right. Please stay with me.

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:02.040
I'm counting on you.

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:05.750
I'll take out the demon.

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:09.130
Water flows from up high to low depths.

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:13.590
Yet at times, its course is reversed,

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:15.680
and it becomes a towering wall of water...

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:16.930
Climb!

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:19.430
Siluca!

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:28.190
Siluca!

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:31.030
Engulf!

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:52.840
Oh no!

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:24.120
Siluca!

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:27.120
Thank goodness!
You're finally awake!

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:29.630
How long have I been asleep?

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:31.340
It's already noon!

00:10:32.050 --> 00:10:33.300
Where's Lord Theo?

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:36.170
He's been dealing with
the aftermath of the fire since last night.

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:39.010
Oh, no! I need to be there, too!

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:46.640
Lord Theo!

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:48.810
See you, then.

00:10:50.230 --> 00:10:51.730
Are you feeling well now?

00:10:54.980 --> 00:10:56.860
Yes. Thanks to you.

00:10:58.490 --> 00:10:59.320
Those wounds...

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:01.740
You need to have them looked at right away!

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:10.210
Forgive me for leaving the cleanup to you.

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:12.500
Also... um...

00:11:13.550 --> 00:11:16.130
Thank you so much for protecting me.

00:11:17.090 --> 00:11:19.010
I'm glad you didn't get hurt.

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:20.840
Yes.

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:26.100
Concerning Clovis, I hear everything went
according to your plan.

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:31.940
Well, Sir Sartorus gave me a talking-to
for ignoring your wishes.

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:34.570
But I'm grateful for what you're doing.

00:11:36.190 --> 00:11:41.280
If I hadn't met you, it never would've
occurred to me to defeat Rossini.

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:44.660
But you showed me the way.

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:50.420
And now, I'm sure
it's exactly what I want to do.

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:54.130
One day, I'm going to lead my forces
and arrive on Systina.

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:56.800
Assuming the family name Cornaro.

00:11:58.420 --> 00:11:59.260
Right!

00:12:00.090 --> 00:12:04.050
That said, there are still many
trials and tribulations ahead.

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:10.350
We'll also be negotiating with the Mage Leader
of the Kreische family, who head the Alliance.

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:13.900
Who is he?

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:16.110
Mage Leader Aubeste.

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:19.190
My mentor, as well as adoptive father.

00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:20.700
Adoptive father?

00:12:21.530 --> 00:12:25.740
Children with magical potential are taken from
their biological parents at a young age,

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:28.450
and raised by a mage
serving as their adoptive father.

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:29.540
I see.

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:35.290
Then sending his daughter to negotiate
shouldn't pose a problem, right?

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:36.670
I certainly hope not...

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:39.960
I'll leave it to you.

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:42.470
You can't just leave it to me, that won't do!

00:12:43.050 --> 00:12:47.100
Because from here on in,
I'm going to consult you on everything first.

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:51.180
I'm not sure that I'll be worthy
of your consultation, though.

00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:53.440
I'll see to it that you are!

00:12:55.520 --> 00:12:57.320
Well, the negotiations were a bust.

00:12:57.820 --> 00:13:01.490
The King of Savis ended up declaring
that he'd settle it on the battlefield.

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:04.240
You wouldn't believe how furious he was!

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:06.990
"All territories in this nation belong to me,

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:10.500
and I can't recognize
anyone's independence," he said.

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:12.500
He said that, did he?

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:14.370
In so many words.

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:16.170
We don't have much time.

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:22.050
Let's write to the free Lords
and ask them to ally with us, right away!

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:39.270
We won't stand a chance
if no one shows, huh?

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:42.900
If it comes to that,
I'll charge the enemy lines alone.

00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:45.280
That way, your lives will be saved.

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:48.620
Charging solo into enemy lines?

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:52.790
I can't let my Lord
be the only one having such fun!

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:55.330
I, too, am fully prepared.

00:13:56.080 --> 00:13:59.540
After all, Lord Theo,
you spared my life in our recent battle.

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:01.550
Sir Neyman...

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:03.170
Sir Lassic...

00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:06.130
Thank you.

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:09.850
If they read our letters,
and realize the king's desires...

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:14.310
I'm sure the free Lords of Savis
will take our side.

00:14:14.310 --> 00:14:20.360
Yeah, but recall on the way over here,
the Lords did let us pass,

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:22.400
but they didn't offer any troops.

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:29.410
The fact we were allowed to pass
shows they have affinity for us.

00:14:31.240 --> 00:14:34.450
So now, as long as even one makes a move...

00:14:36.410 --> 00:14:38.330
<i>Please, somebody come.</i>

00:14:46.970 --> 00:14:47.880
That's...

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:55.180
Is that you, Boss?
What are you doing here?

00:14:55.180 --> 00:14:59.100
It was Lord Theo and you, Lady Siluca,
who saved our town.

00:14:59.730 --> 00:15:03.230
I can't just look away
during your own crisis.

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:09.070
I'm glad you all feel that way.

00:15:09.070 --> 00:15:11.950
But this battle's going to be very intense.

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:15.250
Of course, we're ready to lay down our lives!

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:21.000
But it's my duty as a Lord
to protect my people's lives.

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:22.840
Not make you lay them down!

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:24.090
Excuse me, my Lord,

00:15:24.090 --> 00:15:28.260
but I believe it's also your duty as a Lord
to fulfill your people's wishes.

00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:31.260
Fulfill their wishes...

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:39.770
Please, raise your flag, Lord Theo,
and grant your people its divine blessing.

00:15:40.980 --> 00:15:43.610
So you won't lose
what you truly wish to protect.

00:15:45.230 --> 00:15:47.110
What I truly wish to protect...

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:50.360
Homeland. Family.

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:55.660
Unflinching courage against formidable foes,
when fighting for those very things.

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:58.750
Trust that breeds unswerving solidarity.

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:01.370
Patience to not give up until the bitter end.

00:16:25.570 --> 00:16:28.320
This is the Patriot's Flag!

00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:33.780
I'll be responsible for all your lives!

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:35.580
Let's fight together!

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:52.220
So this is Lord Theo's flag, huh?

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:57.260
Our allies are sure to come.

00:16:57.260 --> 00:17:00.810
Since these people have come,
it is certain to create a massive wave.

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:03.560
I feel the same way.

00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:29.170
I'll show you all!

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:31.970
All forces, charge!

00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:38.300
Do not fear! Follow me!

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:43.520
Peter's squad, spreading out!

00:17:46.520 --> 00:17:48.190
Allow me to guide you...

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:50.610
to the afterlife!

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:07.580
Flash of Light!

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:14.590
We'll pulverize their flank!

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:16.720
Now! Cut into them!

00:18:23.310 --> 00:18:24.180
Let's go!

00:18:27.810 --> 00:18:28.650
Surge forth!

00:18:33.820 --> 00:18:35.950
Stand your ground!
Head for the main unit!

00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:43.410
They're so pesky.

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:46.460
You men head out!
Get them in one fell swoop!

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:48.710
Yes, sir! Count on us!

00:18:55.090 --> 00:18:55.920
Reinforcements?

00:18:56.380 --> 00:18:59.680
The free Lords have allied with Lord Theo!

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:00.970
What?

00:19:00.970 --> 00:19:02.310
King of Savis!

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:05.930
We've heard all about your ulterior motives!

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:10.560
If you think you can subjugate our Crests,
let's see you try!

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:18.200
Lord Naville!

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:28.750
It's futile. Please withdraw for now.

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:34.960
Elude!

00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:38.090
Lord Theo!

00:19:38.090 --> 00:19:40.430
The backup forces from
the free Lords have arrived!

00:19:41.640 --> 00:19:44.180
Now! All forces, charge!

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:46.470
Follow me!

00:19:49.190 --> 00:19:53.480
You bastard!
I swear I'll get you for this humiliation!

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:10.620
Did we... win?

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:13.170
Yes, it's a victory.

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:19.090
Lord Theo, you've defeated the King of Savis.

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:26.260
So magnificent!

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:30.980
Lord Theo must join the Order of the Crest,
no matter what it takes!

00:20:33.770 --> 00:20:37.610
Now, if only I can see
eye to eye with Valdrind...

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:45.870
It's been a long time, Siluca Meletes.

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:49.870
I had a narrow escape in Aram,
thanks to you.

00:20:50.620 --> 00:20:56.380
I am truly sorry that I wasn't able
to save both archdukes, Lady Marrine.

00:20:56.960 --> 00:21:01.800
I know you only had an instant,
but surely there was a better method?

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:05.640
It's been a long time, Father.

00:21:06.010 --> 00:21:10.310
I will remind you that I am now
the Mage Leader of Valdrind's Margrave.

00:21:12.140 --> 00:21:13.400
My apologies, sir.

00:21:14.150 --> 00:21:19.860
I've already explained my purpose here
in the letter I sent in advance.

00:21:20.740 --> 00:21:26.280
My Lord, Viscount Theo Cornaro,
has conquered the entire Savis region.

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:30.160
Therefore, he wishes to join
the Factory Alliance.

00:21:32.410 --> 00:21:33.920
And pledge allegiance to me?

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:35.330
Yes.

00:21:35.330 --> 00:21:39.380
My Lord intends to do everything in his power
to aid you, Lady Marrine Kreische,

00:21:39.380 --> 00:21:41.170
in your conquest of the continent.

00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:44.630
I understand what it is you're proposing.

00:21:45.260 --> 00:21:47.930
Please allow me some time to consider it.

00:21:49.760 --> 00:21:51.180
Understood, my Lady.

00:22:01.110 --> 00:22:05.110
BATTLE FLAG

00:23:35.120 --> 00:23:40.130
EPISODE 4:
